{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "At the Travel Agency", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Sally Needs a Vacation", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 3, "type": "position"}, {"content": "scholar > Out and About in the City > Mexico City", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 4, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A1.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Accurately explain information about interests, hobbies and preferences in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Asking Follow-up Questions (Showing Interest and Surprise)", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "For showing interest and surprise in conversations you can use some verbs with infinitives such as<span class = \"italic\"> want to </span>and<span class = \"italic\"> like to</span>. Also in conversations you can ask short questions about something that someone has just said.<br/><br/><span class=\"strong\">Follow-up Questions: </span><br/> You use follow-up questions when you want to encourage someone to talk more, or to show you are interested or surprised about something. <br/>A follow-up question can start with a Wh-question, like <span class=\"italic\">What, Where, When, Why</span> or <span class=\"italic\">Who</span>.<br/> When you hear something new, you can show you are surprised.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Showing Interest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Showing Surprise\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\"><span class = \\\"strong\\\">Leah</span>: I want to go on vacation.<br/> <span class = \\\"strong\\\">Carol</span>: Where to?<br/><br/><span class = \\\"strong\\\">Leah</span>: I want to ask you something.<br/><span class = \\\"strong\\\">Chris</span>: *Ask me something? What is it?<br/><br/>*You can also use <span class = \\\"italic\\\">Mmhmm</span> to show that you are interested.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\"><span class = \\\"strong\\\">Mike</span>: I want to take some time off from work.<br/> <span class = \\\"strong\\\">Jay</span>: *Time off?<br/><br>* You can also use Really? to show you are surprised.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Some other examples of follow-up questions are: <br/>  <span class = \\\"italic\\\"> When do you leave? <br/> What was it like? <br/> Who did you go with? <br/> Why is that? <br/> How was it?</br>What did you see? <span/>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You can also use these phrases to show surprise: <br/> <span class = \\\"italic\\\">Wow! <br/> No way! <br/> Oh my gosh! <br/> Get out of here!</br>Really?! <span/>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"content": "engenn3le04ob03re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "vacation", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a period of free time", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I need a vacation. I'm tired.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le04ob03aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " These are words you use at work to talk about vacations.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "a little slow", "type": "name"}, {"content": "use this to describe a store with a few customers", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: <span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: How is the store today?<br><span class=\"strong\"> Sasha</span>: It's a little slow.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le04ob03aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "in a good mood", "type": "name"}, {"content": "use this to say that a person is happy", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You seem like you're in a good mood.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le04ob03aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "time off", "type": "name"}, {"content": "time away from work or school", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I want to take time off work.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le04ob03aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "a week off", "type": "name"}, {"content": "one week away from work or school", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I want to take a week off.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le04ob03aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "really ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "use this to express surprise", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: <span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I want to take a week off. <span class=\"strong\">Sasha</span>: Really?!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le04ob03aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Read each role and choose one.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice the situation with your partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Switch roles.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Role 1: </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You are the boss. The clerk asks you for time off for a vacation. You are surprised and interested in what they say. Ask follow-up questions.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Role 2:</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" You are the clerk. You want to go on a vacation. Ask your boss for time off. Answer their questions.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I ask for time off.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I respond to requests using follow-up questions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I show surprise and interest.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"id": 0, "stimuli": [{"id": 0, "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome"}, {"title": "", "id": 2, "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn3le04ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn3le04ob03re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"id": 0, "text": "", "image": "engenn3le04ob03re2img05.jpg", "time": "0"}, {"id": 1, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: Hi, Sasha. How is the store today?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Sasha</span>: It's a little slow today. How are you?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: Great! <br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Sasha</span>: You seem like you're in a good mood. What is it?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: I'm excited, but I'm also a little nervous.<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Sasha</span>: Mmhmm?", "image": "engenn3le04ob03re2img05.jpg", "time": "10"}, {"id": 2, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: Well, I have to ask you something ...<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Sasha</span>: Ask me something? What is it?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: I want to take some time off from work next month.<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Sasha</span>: Time off? You just started this job!<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: I know, but I want to go on a vacation.", "image": "engenn3le04ob03re2img02.jpg", "time": "17500"}, {"id": 3, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Sasha</span>: Where to?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: Maybe Mexico. My friend, Vanessa, is thinking of going.<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Sasha</span>: Maybe I can give you a week off because you helped me at Comic Con.<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>:  Really? Wow! Thanks!<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Sasha</span>: Let's talk about it later ... we have a customer.<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: Sounds good!", "image": "engenn3le04ob03re2img01.jpg", "time": "36500"}]}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio"}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "template_override": 1, "type": "WLC", "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Vocabulary and Grammar", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "I can talk about travel.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can show interest and surprise.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can ask follow-up questions. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "When was your last vacation? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Where did you go?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "What did you do?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct"}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "I want to go on a vacation ... Can I have some time off?", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "img_path": ""}, {"id": 1, "template_override": 1, "questions": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "type": "question"}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}, {"id": 1, "correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type"